## GHI CHU

- Co the chay tung buoc rieng bang cac lenh `/team-*`
- Luon validate frontmatter YAML sau moi lan sua file .md
- Tat ca agent output phai theo YAML contract dinh san
- Artifact luon duoc luu truoc khi chuyen buoc
- Neu workflow bi block o buoc nao, cung cap du thong tin de nguoi dung biet:
  - Dang o buoc nao
  - Workflow ID la gi
  - Artifact hien tai la gi
  - Can quyet dinh gi
- Khi workflow hoan tat, output bao cao phai day du va ro rang
- Self-improvement chi tao suggestion, can review + approve truoc khi ghi vao knowledge base
